OL,3,GNEWSAFamily refused Pizza Express entry
OL,4,Aover boy's 'safe foods'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother says her son who has severe
OL,7,Ffood allergies blamed himself when the
OL,8,Ffamily was refused entry at a
OL,9,Frestaurant because he had his own food
OL,10,Fwith him.
OL,12,FHazel, 41, from Halesworth, Suffolk,
OL,13,Fvisited Pizza Express at the South
OL,14,FMimms M25 services in Hertfordshire
OL,15,Fwith her son Francis, nine, and the
OL,16,Frest of their family on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
