OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFamily refused Pizza Express entry
OL,4,Aover boy's 'safe foods'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to his allergies, they always take
OL,7,Fhis own food to restaurants, but Pizza
OL,8,FExpress staff said they could not allow
OL,9,Fthem in as it meant they could not
OL,10,Fcontrol the allergens in the restaurant
OL,11,F` and Francis felt it was all his
OL,12,Ffault.
OL,14,FPizza Express has apologised. It said
OL,15,Finclusivity was at its "core" and it
OL,16,Fwas "very disappointed to learn of this
OL,17,Fisolated incident".
